    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but i really cant get to a doctor until next week and the tooth pain is making it impossible to sleep. the omeprazole usually keeps the stomach stuff under control anyway, so i figured it would just protect my stomach from the ibuprofen. is there really a big risk if i just take a couple of advil for now? it's just for the tooth, not for my stomach.",
