      "content": "i dont really want to use a mouthwash isnt that just a temporary fix. i feel like i've got this handled with the omeprazole. i've read online that ppl take ibuprofen all the time even if they have sensitive stomachs as long as they take it with food. if i just take like 200mg or 400mg with a big meal, isn't that basically safe? i really just need to get through the night without this tooth throbbing.",
